cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AutoBoat VT - Main Software Package for the Virginia Tech AutoBoat Autonomous Surface Vessel Team"
abstract: >-
  ROS 2 (Humble) workspace for the Virginia Tech AutoBoat autonomous surface
  vessel team. Includes the PyQt ground station with an embedded Vite/TypeScript
  Leaflet map widget, Raspberry Pi Pico (RP2040) firmware running micro-ROS,
  Gazebo simulation plugins, and Docker/devcontainer tooling.
authors:
  - name: "Virginia Tech AutoBoat Team"
    affiliation: "Virginia Tech"
